WEBVTT

00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:17,470
Um, question coming. I just got my right machine, uh, how close do you put the light, um,

00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:24,590
to next to your body? Well, it depends on if you have the amplifier connected. So if you have

00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:30,670
that jack hammer amplifier connected to it, then you could put the ball underneath the bed.

00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:37,310
Because it'll go right through the mattress and it'll affect you a beneficially. Now the amplifier

00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:48,750
is a relatively new addition to the right machines. So, uh, uh, uh, most of our patients don't have

00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:53,790
that. Don't have the jackhammer. So they're putting the ball right next to them. They're snugly

00:00:53,790 --> 00:01:01,230
with the ball. But if you have the amplifier, it amplifies the frequency. So it gives it more power.

00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:08,670
So if you do put the ball right next to you with the amplifier connected, you might experience

00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:15,070
some static electricity. Somebody might come, your wife might come and give you a kiss and she gets

00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:19,390
shocked, okay? It's just static electricity. It's not dangerous. It's, uh, it's, uh,

00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:25,790
electrostatic electricity. Electrons are forming on the outside of your body. So there's nothing

00:01:25,870 --> 00:01:32,510
harmful. It's just like when you rub your feet with your socks on on the carpet and then you go touch

00:01:32,510 --> 00:01:37,630
something. Actually, electrons are attaching to the outside of your body and then discharging when

00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:44,110
you touch something else. So there's no harm in that. But, um, it's not very comfortable, you know,

00:01:44,110 --> 00:01:49,230
if somebody your wife reaches over and gets shocked every time she touches you or something like that.

00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:56,590
So the reason why you would use the amplifier is because maybe you don't, you don't like

00:01:56,590 --> 00:02:01,870
the ball next to you. You want it under your bed. There's maybe reasons why you'd want it under

00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:08,110
your bed. You don't want it right next to you. Um, personally, I don't use the amplifier. And

00:02:08,110 --> 00:02:16,030
again, most of our patients don't use the amplifier and they just take that off and then just use it,

00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:21,630
just the bulb connected directly to the machine, red and black connector, the red black outlet on

00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:27,870
the machine. And then you put the bulb just next to you in your bed. Um, that's my preferred way.

00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:33,390
The only reason why I would tell somebody to use the amplifier and to put the bulb under the bed

00:02:33,390 --> 00:02:39,310
is if they just, you know, have issues with anything in bed with them or they don't sleep with covers

00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:46,910
on it all, the light is annoying or something like that.

